ה וּמִןֿ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,5)\">Ezek 42:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 42:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,42,6)\">Ezek 42:6</ref>, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 20:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,20,4)\">2Kgs 20:4</ref> <bdbheb>הָעִיר הַתִּיכֹנָה</bdbheb> (but read with <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vrss')\"><reflink>Vrss</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חָצֵר הַתּ</bdbheb>, i.e. the <bdbheb>חָצֵר הָאַחֶרֶת</bdbheb>, see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>חָצֵר</reflink></bdbheb> <b>2</b>). — <bdbheb>חָצֵר הַתִּיכוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 47:16\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(26,47,16)\">Ezek 47:16</ref>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>תּוֺכֵחָה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>תּוֺכַ֫חַת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>יכח</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>תּוּכִּ יִּים</bdbheb> see <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תּכּ</bdbheb>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>תּוֺלָ֫ד</bdbheb>, [<bdbheb>תּוֺלֵדוֺת</bdbheb>] see  <bdbheb><reflink>ילד</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>תולון</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>תִּילוֺן</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 26:28", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 26, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Judg 7:19", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 7, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ezek 42:5", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 42, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezek 42:6", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 42, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Exod 36:33", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 36, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "1Kgs 6:6", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 6, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "1Kgs 6:8", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 6, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Ezek 41:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 41, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "2Kgs 20:4", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 20, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Ezek 47:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 47, "verse": 16}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["תִּיכוֺן", "תִּיכֹן", "׳", "תּ", "תִּ(י)